Z||000012||80's BOY||05-24-2001||10:41 AM||||yeah, the car was a fresh rebuild by the previous owners and my friend is a diesel mechanic so he's got engine smarts. the car is for his wife to drive. not in bad condition at all. it was sitting up for about 3 years but from the sound of it, i think the previous owners never timed it after the engine was put back in. take into consideration: old gas, gummed up plugs, horrid wiring to the battery and alternator, melted bulkhead connectors, rusty fuel filter, AND no oxygen sensor it's no wonder the damn thing bogs out. other than that it's just fine  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by 80's BOY (edited 05-24-2001).]||||reg||14
